From 90667ea7807f809c4317e247451a3dbce03aa77d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mod Author <mod@local>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 07:46:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Raise parallel connection cap to 64 (native tier) with
 capacity & memory guards

Config chain: MAX_PARALLEL_CONNECTION_COUNT_NATIVE_MEMORY=64 as single
source of truth (read clamp, both write clamps, UI slider).
Capacity: executor 32->80 core, connection pool idle 32->128,
dispatcher 64/32->128/128 (defensive; sync calls bypass it).
Memory: depth floor conn+1 (was forced 2x conn, overcommitting and
crashing coerceIn at 64), engine-side chunk guard on the native tier.
Retry: chunk budget 2->4 attempts, jittered 50-80ms pause.
UA: honest versioned player identity on the playback chain (was
desktop-Chrome string contradicting TLS fingerprint + Range behavior).
429 fuse, Retry-After, warm session, eviction guard untouched.
